lor%3A%20%232d3436%3B%5C%22%3E%5Cn%20%5Ct%3Cli%3EMengenalkan%20dan%20menanamkan%20ajaran%20agama%20sejak%20dini%20kepada%20peserta%20didik%2C%20sehingga%20dapat%20diamalkan%20dalam%20kehidupan%20sehari-hari.%3C%2Fli%3E%5Cn%20%5Ct%3Cli%3EMembentuk%20karakter%20anak%20yang%20berakhlak%20mulia%3C%2Fli%3E%5Cn%20%5Ct%3Cli%3EMengembangkan%20potensi%20diri%20peserta%20didik%20agar%20memiliki%20keterampilan%20sesuai%20dengan%20bakat%20dan%20minat%3C%2Fli%3E%5Cn%20%5Ct%3Cli%3EMenerapkan%20sistem%20pendidikan%20yang%20berbasis%20ilmu%20pengetahuan%20dan%20teknologi%20(TIK)%3C%2Fli%3E%5Cn%20%5Ct%3Cli%3EAktif%20dalam%20mengembangkan%20sistem%20pendidikan%20yang%20unggul%20didukung%20oleh%20tenaga%20pendidik%20yang%20berkualitas%20tinggi%3C%2Fli%3E%5Cn%20%5Ct%3Cli%3EMenyediakan%20sarana%20dan%20prasarana%20sekolah%20yang%20modern%20untuk%20menunjang%20proses%20belajar%20mengajar%3C%2Fli%3E%5Cn%3C%2Fol%3E%22%7D%5D\" style=\"style2\" text_color=\"#8d8d8d\" border_color=\"#d4d4d4\" accent_color=\"#505050\" border_accent_color=\"#691a8f\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Visi Dan Misi', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'visi-dan-misi', '', '', '2023-01-06 08:48:12', '2023-01-06 08:48:12', '', 0, 'https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/?page_id=227', 0, 'page', '', 0);
