(176, 1, '2022-10-15 00:15:11', '2022-10-15 00:15:11', '[vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content\" equal_height=\"yes\" content_placement=\"middle\" column_order=\"reversed\" el_id=\"trainer\"][vc_column width=\"1/2\" shadow=\"shadow1\" max_width=\"735\" css=\".vc_custom_1533130801073{padding-top: 200px !important;padding-bottom: 200px !important;}\" padding_tablet=\"70px 40px 70px 40px\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1665792872284{margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;}\"]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 30px; color: #505050;\"><strong>PROGRAM SEKOLAH</strong></span></p>\r\n[/vc_column_text][vcj_empty_space height=\"20px\"][vcj_divider width=\"fixed\" fixed_width=\"20\" type=\"solid\" height=\"5\" radius=\"30\" alignment=\"left\" line_color=\"#eaeaea\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"20px\"][vc_column_text]Sekolah Hamidah Sampurna memiliki program unggulan penerapan konsep bilingual :\r\n- Program perjalanan ke luar negeri untuk menerapkan ilmu bahasa asing, - Program Umrah pelajar,\r\n- Program Study Tour &amp; Science Competition di luar negeri.\r\n\r\n***\r\nSekolah Hamidah Sampurna\r\nIslamic - Science and Technology\r\nPaud - TK - SD - SMP[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1665792907258{background-image: url(https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/309496483_589741346267306_2373337706780680397_n.jpg?id=150) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\" padding_tablet=\"100px 0px 100px 0px\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Program Sekolah', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '174-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-10-15 00:15:11', '2022-10-15 00:15:11', '', 174, 'https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/?p=176', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(179, 1, '2022-10-15 00:20:07', '2022-10-15 00:20:07', '[vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content_no_spaces\" equal_height=\"yes\" content_placement=\"middle\" css=\".vc_custom_1532607481474{margin-top: 0px !important;padding-top: 90px !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/2\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1665793203969{padding-top: 150px !important;padding-bottom: 150px !important;background: #e0e0e0 url(https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/311477176_470305365162300_1130260216767246574_n.jpg?id=164) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column css_animation=\"fadeIn\" width=\"1/2\" shadow=\"shadow2\" css=\".vc_custom_1532607591506{padding-top: 150px !important;padding-right: 45px !important;padding-bottom: 170px !important;padding-left: 45px !important;background-color: #f9f9f9 !important;}\" max_width=\"700px\" padding_tablet=\"60px 30px 60px 30px\"][vcj_heading_simple content2=\"PPDB\" alignment=\"left\" color_text=\"#8d8d8d\" weight=\"400\" italic=\"\" size=\"custom\" desktop_size=\"18px\" letter_spacing=\"11px\" animation_speed=\"2\" animation_delay=\"0\"][vcj_heading_simple content2=\"PENDAFTARAN SEKOLAH HAMIDAH SAMPURNA\" alignment=\"left\" color_text=\"#505050\" italic=\"\" size=\"l\" animation_speed=\"2\" animation_delay=\"0\" margin=\"15px 0px 0px 0px\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"35px\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1665793144568{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"]Assalamulaikum\r\nسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَنِ الرَّحِيم\r\nAdik-adik dan orang tau calon peserta didik sekolah hamidah sampurna,\r\nSekolah hamidah sampurna membuka pendaftaran bagi calon peserta didik baru tahun ajaran 2023/2024, yuk buruan daftarkan putra-putri ada di sekolah terbaik di kabupaten bandung\r\n\r\n🧪 PAUD\r\n📡 TK\r\n⚙️ SD\r\n🖥️ SMP\r\n\r\n👉🏻Biaya Pendidikan Termasuk :\r\n💻 Edu-Tab\r\n📖 Modul Cambridge\r\n👳🏻‍♀️Program Tahfidz\r\n🖥️ TOEFL/IELTS Preparation\r\n💵 Biaya SPP Awal Tahun\r\n📚 Buku Paket 1 Tahun\r\n👔 Seragam Sekolah\r\n🚌 Study Tour 2x\r\n🤾🏼‍♂️ Outbond Leadership\r\n🏥 Asuransi Siswa\r\n\r\nUntuk Pendaftaran dapat menghubungi :\r\n☎️Devina - 0811 261 206\r\n☎️Nuh - 0878 999 60061\r\n☎️Ryni - 0811 240 9090\r\n\r\nAlamat Sekolah :\r\n🏢 Jalan Siliwangi No.386 Manggahang, Baleendah, Kab bandung\r\nAlamat Pendaftaran :\r\n📌 Jalan Raya Laswi No.130 C, Manggahang, Baleendah, Kab. Bandung\r\n\r\nBuruan Daftar 🥰[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'PPDB', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '177-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-10-15 00:20:07', '2022-10-15 00:20:07', '', 177, 'https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/?p=179', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(180, 1, '2022-10-15 00:21:42', '2022-10-15 00:21:42', '[vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content_no_spaces\" equal_height=\"yes\" content_placement=\"middle\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1665793299178{margin-top: 0px !important;padding-top: 90px !important;padding-bottom: 90px !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/2\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1665793203969{padding-top: 150px !important;padding-bottom: 150px !important;background: #e0e0e0 url(https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/311477176_470305365162300_1130260216767246574_n.jpg?id=164) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column css_animation=\"fadeIn\" width=\"1/2\" shadow=\"shadow2\" css=\".vc_custom_1532607591506{padding-top: 150px !important;padding-right: 45px !important;padding-bottom: 170px !important;padding-left: 45px !important;background-color: #f9f9f9 !important;}\" max_width=\"700px\" padding_tablet=\"60px 30px 60px 30px\"][vcj_heading_simple content2=\"PPDB\" alignment=\"left\" color_text=\"#8d8d8d\" weight=\"400\" italic=\"\" size=\"custom\" desktop_size=\"18px\" letter_spacing=\"11px\" animation_speed=\"2\" animation_delay=\"0\"][vcj_heading_simple content2=\"PENDAFTARAN SEKOLAH HAMIDAH SAMPURNA\" alignment=\"left\" color_text=\"#505050\" italic=\"\" size=\"l\" animation_speed=\"2\" animation_delay=\"0\" margin=\"15px 0px 0px 0px\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"35px\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1665793144568{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"]Assalamulaikum\r\nسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَنِ الرَّحِيم\r\nAdik-adik dan orang tau calon peserta didik sekolah hamidah sampurna,\r\nSekolah hamidah sampurna membuka pendaftaran bagi calon peserta didik baru tahun ajaran 2023/2024, yuk buruan daftarkan putra-putri ada di sekolah terbaik di kabupaten bandung\r\n\r\n🧪 PAUD\r\n📡 TK\r\n⚙️ SD\r\n🖥️ SMP\r\n\r\n👉🏻Biaya Pendidikan Termasuk :\r\n💻 Edu-Tab\r\n📖 Modul Cambridge\r\n👳🏻‍♀️Program Tahfidz\r\n🖥️ TOEFL/IELTS Preparation\r\n💵 Biaya SPP Awal Tahun\r\n📚 Buku Paket 1 Tahun\r\n👔 Seragam Sekolah\r\n🚌 Study Tour 2x\r\n🤾🏼‍♂️ Outbond Leadership\r\n🏥 Asuransi Siswa\r\n\r\nUntuk Pendaftaran dapat menghubungi :\r\n☎️Devina - 0811 261 206\r\n☎️Nuh - 0878 999 60061\r\n☎️Ryni - 0811 240 9090\r\n\r\nAlamat Sekolah :\r\n🏢 Jalan Siliwangi No.386 Manggahang, Baleendah, Kab bandung\r\nAlamat Pendaftaran :\r\n📌 Jalan Raya Laswi No.130 C, Manggahang, Baleendah, Kab. Bandung\r\n\r\nBuruan Daftar 🥰[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'PPDB', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '177-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-10-15 00:21:42', '2022-10-15 00:21:42', '', 177, 'https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/?p=180', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
