li>\r\n 	<li>AC &amp; CCTV di setiap kelas</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1637829796330{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"Profil Sekolah Hamidah Sampurna\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:30px|text_align:center|color:%232c3e50\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"][vc_separator color=\"peacoc\" border_width=\"2\" el_width=\"10\" css=\".vc_custom_1637823322272{margin-top: -9px !important;margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_video link=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OL2qtf87Rvs&amp;t=6s\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_column_text]\r\n<ul style=\"color: #000; font-family: montserrat; font-size: 16px;\">\r\n 	<li>Yayasan Pendidikan Islam (YPI)</li>\r\n 	<li>Sekolah Hamidah Sampurna berdiri pada tanggal 17 November 2021. Didirikan oleh Ibu Ryni Van Ditta.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1637831679277{margin-top: 30px !important;}\" el_id=\"gallery\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"Galeri Kegiatan\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:30px|text_align:center|color:%232c3e50\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"][vc_separator color=\"peacoc\" border_width=\"2\" el_width=\"10\" css=\".vc_custom_1637823322272{margin-top: -9px !important;margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vcj_image_gallery images=\"152,150,146,143,140,137,134,131,128,125,122\" columns=\"4columns\" margin=\"0px 7px 0px 7px\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1637831691265{margin-top: 45px !important;}\" el_id=\"berita\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"Berita\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:30px|text_align:center|color:%232c3e50\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"][vc_separator color=\"peacoc\" border_width=\"2\" el_width=\"10\" css=\".vc_custom_1637823322272{margin-top: -9px !important;margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_raw_html]JTVCcHNhY19wb3N0X2Nhcm91c2VsJTIwc2xpZGVfc2hvdyUzRCUyMjMlMjIlMjBkb3RzJTNEJTIyZmFsc2UlMjIlMjBhcnJvd3MlM0QlMjJmYWxzZSUyMiUyMGF1dG9wbGF5JTNEJTIydHJ1ZSUyMiUyMGF1dG9wbGF5X2ludGVydmFsJTNEJTIyMzAwMCUyMiUyMHNwZWVkJTNEJTIyODAwJTIyJTVE[/vc_raw_html][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '9-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-10-25 13:30:51', '2022-10-25 13:30:51', '', 9, 'https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/?p=276', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
