(351, 1, '2022-12-09 17:13:09', '2022-12-09 17:13:09', '<p>[vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content_no_spaces\" equal_height=\"yes\" content_placement=\"middle\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1665793299178{margin-top: 0px !important;padding-top: 90px !important;padding-bottom: 90px !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/2\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1670605825351{padding-top: 150px !important;padding-bottom: 150px !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][vcj_single_image image=\"164\" size=\"full\" radius=\"0\" lightbox=\"1\" overlay=\"disabled\" animation_speed=\"2\" animation_delay=\"0\"][/vc_column][vc_column css_animation=\"fadeIn\" width=\"1/2\" shadow=\"shadow2\" css=\".vc_custom_1532607591506{padding-top: 150px !important;padding-right: 45px !important;padding-bottom: 170px !important;padding-left: 45px !important;background-color: #f9f9f9 !important;}\" max_width=\"700px\" padding_tablet=\"60px 30px 60px 30px\"][vcj_heading_simple content2=\"PPDB\" alignment=\"left\" color_text=\"#8d8d8d\" weight=\"400\" italic=\"\" size=\"custom\" desktop_size=\"18px\" letter_spacing=\"11px\" animation_speed=\"2\" animation_delay=\"0\"][vcj_text_block paragraph_whitespace=\"\"]</p>\n<p style=\"color: #505050; font-family: nizzoli-bold; font-size: 38px; text-align: left;\">Sekolah Hamidah Sampurna</p>\n<p>[/vcj_text_block][vcj_empty_space height=\"35px\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1665793144568{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"]Assalamulaikum<br />\nسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَنِ الرَّحِيم<br />\nAdik-adik dan orang tau calon peserta didik sekolah hamidah sampurna,<br />\nSekolah hamidah sampurna membuka pendaftaran bagi calon peserta didik baru tahun ajaran 2023/2024, yuk buruan daftarkan putra-putri ada di sekolah terbaik di kabupaten bandung</p>\n<p>🧪 PAUD<br />\n📡 TK<br />\n⚙️ SD<br />\n🖥️ SMP</p>\n<p>👉🏻Biaya Pendidikan Termasuk :<br />\n💻 Edu-Tab<br />\n📖 Modul Cambridge<br />\n👳🏻‍♀️Program Tahfidz<br />\n🖥️ TOEFL/IELTS Preparation<br />\n💵 Biaya SPP Awal Tahun<br />\n📚 Buku Paket 1 Tahun<br />\n👔 Seragam Sekolah<br />\n🚌 Study Tour 2x<br />\n🤾🏼‍♂️ Outbond Leadership<br />\n🏥 Asuransi Siswa</p>\n<p>Untuk Pendaftaran dapat menghubungi :<br />\n☎️Devina - 0811 261 206<br />\n☎️Nuh - 0878 999 60061<br />\n☎️Ryni - 0811 240 9090</p>\n<p>Alamat Sekolah :<br />\n🏢 Jalan Siliwangi No.386 Manggahang, Baleendah, Kab bandung<br />\nAlamat Pendaftaran :<br />\n📌 Jalan Raya Laswi No.130 C, Manggahang, Baleendah, Kab. Bandung</p>\n<p>Buruan Daftar 🥰[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content_no_spaces\" equal_height=\"yes\" content_placement=\"middle\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1665793299178{margin-top: 0px !important;padding-top: 90px !important;padding-bottom: 90px !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/2\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1670605825351{padding-top: 150px !important;padding-bottom: 150px !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"35px\"][vcj_heading_simple content2=\"OPEN REGISTRATION\" alignment=\"left\" color_text=\"#8d8d8d\" weight=\"600\" italic=\"\" size=\"l\" letter_spacing=\"11px\" animation_speed=\"2\" animation_delay=\"0\"][vcj_text_block paragraph_whitespace=\"\"]</p>\n<p style=\"color: #505050; font-family: nizzoli-bold; font-size: 38px; text-align: left;\">Sekolah Hamidah Sampurna</p>\n<p>[/vcj_text_block][/vc_column][vc_column css_animation=\"fadeIn\" width=\"1/2\" shadow=\"shadow2\" css=\".vc_custom_1532607591506{padding-top: 150px !important;padding-right: 45px !important;padding-bottom: 170px !important;padding-left: 45px !important;background-color: #f9f9f9 !important;}\" max_width=\"700px\" padding_tablet=\"60px 30px 60px 30px\"][vcj_single_image image=\"164\" size=\"full\" radius=\"0\" lightbox=\"1\" overlay=\"disabled\