ah Hamidah Sampurna menggunakan sistem informasi terpadu untuk sekolah, yang dapat membantu Orang Tua dalam melihat Aktivitas dan Capaian anak selama melakukan pembelajaran di sekolah.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1665794318031{padding-top: 200px !important;padding-bottom: 200px !important;background: #ffffff url(https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/309161994_1264583770968501_2830266110113308491_n.jpg?id=128) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_row_inner equal_height=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1532961714454{padding-top: 70px !important;}\"][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1665794797831{padding-top: 200px !important;padding-bottom: 200px !important;background: #ffffff url(https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/309345011_204152131953835_6720440829958339878_n.jpg?id=125) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\" shadow=\"shadow1\" max_width=\"680px\" css=\".vc_custom_1532963203302{padding-top: 120px !important;}\" padding_tablet=\"50px 30px 30px 30px\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"15px\"][vcj_heading_simple content2=\"FASILITAS MODERN\" alignment=\"left\" color_text=\"#505050\" italic=\"\" size=\"l\" animation_speed=\"2\" animation_delay=\"0\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"15px\"][vc_column_text]Sekolah Hamidah Sampurna memberikan Fasilitas Modern untuk menunjang peserta didik dalam melakukan pembelajaran di sekolah.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_row_inner equal_height=\"yes\"][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\" shadow=\"shadow1\" max_width=\"680px\" css=\".vc_custom_1532963345954{padding-top: 70px !important;}\" padding_tablet=\"70px 30px 50px 30px\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"15px\"][vcj_heading_simple content2=\"PEMBELAJARAN AGAMA BERPEDOMAN AL-QUR\'AN DAN SUNNAH\" alignment=\"left\" color_text=\"#505050\" italic=\"\" size=\"l\" animation_speed=\"2\" animation_delay=\"0\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"15px\"][vc_column_text]Pembelajaran Agama Berpedoman Pada Al-Quran Dan Sunnah. Sekolah Hamidah Sampurna menggunakan pembelajaran Agama Islam yang berpedoman pada Al-Quran dan Sunnah.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1665794901229{padding-top: 200px !important;padding-bottom: 200px !important;background: #ffffff url(https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/309226783_5713121422073581_170488053523641445_n.jpg?id=122) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Program Sekolah', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '174-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-12-28 06:48:37', '2022-12-28 06:48:37', '', 174, 'https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/?p=392', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
