ustom_1665794227065{padding-top: 200px !important;padding-bottom: 200px !important;background: #ffffff url(https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/309548220_1252054455593219_8182399656684001997_n.jpg?id=131) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_row_inner equal_height=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1532961714454{padding-top: 70px !important;}\"][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1665793842720{padding-top: 200px !important;padding-bottom: 200px !important;background: #ffffff url(https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/308961103_1046716326019344_7768988557906766487_n.jpg?id=140) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\" shadow=\"shadow1\" max_width=\"680px\" css=\".vc_custom_1532963203302{padding-top: 120px !important;}\" padding_tablet=\"50px 30px 30px 30px\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"15px\"][vcj_heading_simple content2=\"MENGENAL TEKNOLOGI\" alignment=\"left\" color_text=\"#505050\" italic=\"\" size=\"l\" animation_speed=\"2\" animation_delay=\"0\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"15px\"][vc_column_text]Sekolah Hamidah Sampurna mengenalkan teknologi sejak dini, sehingga siswa dapat menggunakan serta memanfaatkan teknologi lebih produktif.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_row_inner equal_height=\"yes\"][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\" shadow=\"shadow1\" max_width=\"680px\" css=\".vc_custom_1532963345954{padding-top: 70px !important;}\" padding_tablet=\"70px 30px 50px 30px\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"15px\"][vcj_heading_simple content2=\"SISTEM INFORMASI SEKOLAH TERPADU\" alignment=\"left\" color_text=\"#505050\" italic=\"\" size=\"l\" animation_speed=\"2\" animation_delay=\"0\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"15px\"][vc_column_text]Sekolah Hamidah Sampurna menggunakan sistem informasi terpadu untuk sekolah, yang dapat membantu Orang Tua dalam melihat Aktivitas dan Capaian anak selama melakukan pembelajaran di sekolah.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1665794318031{padding-top: 200px !important;padding-bottom: 200px !important;background: #ffffff url(https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/309161994_1264583770968501_2830266110113308491_n.jpg?id=128) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_row_inner equal_height=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1532961714454{padding-top: 70px !important;}\"][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1665794797831{padding-top: 200px !important;padding-bottom: 200px !important;background: #ffffff url(https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/309345011_204152131953835_6720440829958339878_n.jpg?id=125) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\" shadow=\"shadow1\" max_width=\"680px\" css=\".vc_custom_1532963203302{padding-top: 120px !important;}\" padding_tablet=\"50px 30px 30px 30px\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"15px\"][vcj_heading_simple content2=\"FASILITAS MODERN\" alignment=\"left\" color_text=\"#505050\" italic=\"\" size=\"l\" animation_speed=\"2\" animation_delay=\"0\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"15px\"][vc_column_text]Sekolah Hamidah Sampurna memberikan Fasilitas Modern untuk menunjang peserta didik dalam melakukan pembelajaran di sekolah.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_row_inner equal_height=\"yes\"][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\" shadow=\"shadow1\" max_width=\"680px\" css=\".vc_custom_1532963345954{padding-top: 70px !important;}\" padding_tablet=\"70px 30px 50px 30px\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"15px\"][vcj_heading_simple content2=\"PEMBELAJARAN AGAMA BERPEDOMAN AL-QUR\'AN DAN SUNNAH\" alignment=\"left\" color_text=\"#505050\" italic=\"\" size=\"l\" animation_speed=\"2\" animation_delay=\"0\"][vcj_empty_space height=\"15px\"][vc_column_text]Pembelajaran Agama Berpedoman Pada Al-Quran Dan Sunnah. Sekolah Hamidah Sampurna menggunakan pembelajaran Agama Islam yang berpedoman pada Al-Quran dan Sunnah.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\" overflow=\"default\" css=\".vc_custom_1665794901229{padding-top: 200px !important;padding-bottom: 200px !important;background: #ffffff url(https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/309226783_5713121422073581_170488053523641445_n.jpg?id=122) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Program Sekolah', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '174-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-12-28 06:44:45', '2022-12-28 06:44:45', '', 174, 'https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/?p=389', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(391, 1, '2022-12-28 06:48:37', '2022-12-28 06:48:37', '.sh-titlebar {\n	display: none; \n}\n.sh-header .container {\n	height: 95px; \n  margin-top: -10px;\n}\n.sh-header {\n/* 	border-bottom: 4px solid #7cbf3f; */\n	border-bottom: 4px solid #542d88; */\n}   \n.sh-sticky-header-active {\n	height: 90px;\n} \n.icon.icon-magnifier {\n	display: none;\n} \n.sh-header:not(.sh-header-4):not(.sh-header-5):not(.sh-header-6) .sh-nav > li.menu-item > a {\n	color: #000;\n	font-family: roboto !important; \n	font-weight: 500;\n}\n.sh-header-right-side, .header-mobile-social-media a, .sh-header .sh-nav > li.menu-item ul, .sh-header-left-side .sh-nav > li.menu-item ul, .sh-header-mobile-dropdown {\n    background-color: #ffff!important;\n    width: 300px;\n    padding: 0px 20px;\n    margin: 0px auto;\n	  border-top: 3px solid #2ea3f2;\n} \n.sh-header-mobile-dropdown .sh-nav-container .sh-nav-mobile li a {\n	color: #000000db !important;\n	border-bottom: none !important;\n} \n.sh-header-mobile-dropdown .sh-nav-container .sh-nav-mobile {\n	width: 260px; \n}\n.sh-header-mobile-dropdown .sh-nav-container .sh-nav-mobile li:after {\n	height: 0px;\n	border-bottom: 1px solid #f2f2f2;  \n}\n.sh-header-mobile-dropdown .sh-nav-container .header-mobile-form-input {\n	display: none;\n} \n.header-mobile-social-media a i, .sh-nav-mobile li a, .sh-header .sh-nav > li.menu-item ul a, .sh-header-left-side .sh-nav > li.menu-item ul a, .header-mobile-search .header-mobile-form .header-mobile-form-input, .header-mobile-search .header-mobile-form-submit {\n    color: #000!important;\n}\n.sh-nav-mobile .current_page_item > a, .sh-nav-mobile > li a:hover, .sh-header .sh-nav ul, .sh-header:not(.sh-header-megamenu-style2) .sh-nav > li.menu-item:not(.menu-item-cart) ul a:hover, .sh-header .sh-nav ul.mega-menu-row li.mega-menu-col > a, .sh-header .woocommerce a.remove:hover:before, .sh-header-left-side .sh-nav ul, .sh-header-left-side .sh-nav > li.menu-item:not(.menu-item-cart) ul a:hover, .sh-header-left-side .sh-nav ul.mega-menu-row li.mega-menu-col > a, .sh-header-left-side .woocommerce a.remove:hover:before {\n    color: #8b9932!important;\n}\n.sh-nav > li.menu-item:not(.menu-item-cart) ul a:hover, .sh-nav-cart .menu-item-cart .total {\n    border-bottom: none !important;\n} \n.sh-header:not(.sh-header-4):not(.sh-header-5):not(.sh-header-6) .sh-nav > li.menu-item > a {\n	color: #000 !important;\n}\n.sh-header:not(.sh-header-4):not(.sh-header-5):not(.sh-header-6) .sh-nav > li.menu-item > a:hover {\n	color: #438dc2 !important;\n	transition: color 0.4s;\n}\n\n/* Section 2 */\n.float_icon {\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 0px !important;\n    margin-bottom: -81px;\n    z-index: 1;\n    left: 0px;\n    right: 0px;\n    bottom: 0px;\n    top: -100px !important;\n}\n\n.float_icon .sh-iconbox {\n    padding: 15px !important;\n    border-radius: 20px !important;\n    background-color: #542d88;\n    box-shadow: rgb(17 17 26 / 10%) 0px 4px 16px, rgb(17 17 26 / 5%) 0px 8px 32px !important;\n	 	height: 275px;\n}\n\n#okapi-wasb-icon{\n	margin-bottom:80px;\n	margin-right:20px;\n}\n\n.exampleTitle {\n	font-family: \"nizzoli-blackit\";\n}\n\n.titleSlider{\n	font-family: \"nizzoli-bold\" !important;\n}\n/* \n  ##Device = Tablets, Ipads (portrait)\n*/\n\n@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1024px) {\n  .float_icon .sh-iconbox {\n	 	height: 290px;\n	} \n}\n\n@media (min-width: 320px) and (max-width: 480px) {\n  .float_icon .sh-iconbox {\n	 	height: 570px;\n	}\n	\n	.facilitiy{\n		display: none !important;\n	}\n	.facilitiyMobile{\n		display: block !important;\n	}\n	\n	#kontak #col3{\n		margin-top:-20px;\n	}\n}\n\n/* Page Visi Misi */\n#pageVisiMisi img{\n	width:350px !important;\n}\n/* End Page Visi Misi */\n\n\n/* Page Visi Misi */\n#program_school img{\n	width:350px !important;\n}\n/* End Page Visi Misi */', 'jevelin', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '30-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-12-28 06:48:37', '2022-12-28 06:48:37', '', 30, 'https://sekolahhamidahsampurna.sch.id/?p=391', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
